Package: jmvReport
Type: Package
Title: AI Report Writer for jamovi (APA Method and Results Text)
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Fikret Bartu", family = "Yurdacan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fbartuyurdacan@trakya.edu.tr")
Description: Writes APA-style Method and Results paragraphs (Turkish or English)
    for analyses performed in jamovi. Reads every analysis stored in a saved
    jamovi (.omv) file, re-computes the results, and generates report text with
    a deterministic template engine. Optionally polishes the text with a local
    large language model served by Ollama; numbers are never generated by the
    model and are verified against the computed results. Also provides wrapper
    analyses (t-test, one-way ANOVA, correlation, contingency tables) that show
    the report text directly under the tables.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
